<h1>Welcome to XIVAuth!</h1>
<p>
  Thank you for creating an XIVAuth account! Before you can sign in for the first time, you need to verify your email
  address. Please be aware that the verification link below will expire after 14 days.
</p>

<div class="btn-cta-wrap">
  <%= link_to 'Verify Now', confirmation_url(@resource, confirmation_token: @token), class: "btn bg-primary" %>
</div>

<p>
  After successfully verifying your email address, your XIVAuth account will be activated and you will be able to
  create and verify characters, sign in to XIVAuth-protected services, and manage developer applications.
</p>
<p>
  If you have any questions or issues, feel free to <a href="mailto:xivauth@wolf.dev">email Kaz directly</a>, or ping
  <code>@kazwolfe</code> in the <a href="<%= discord_url %>">XIVAuth Discord</a> server.
</p>

<p>Thanks,<br>XIVAuth User Management Service</p>

<hr class="divider">

<p class="fine-print">
  If you're having trouble with the button above, copy and paste this URL into your browser:<br>
  <span style="font-family: monospace;"><%= confirmation_url(@resource, confirmation_token: @token) %></span>
</p>
